{"about_the_game":"TowerHex is a virtual reality escape game where you and your team set out on a quest to find a missing alchemist. He disappeared while investigating an ancient ritual on crystal energy. Following his footsteps, you will have to climb old castle ruins inside a lava mountain. To get ahead you will have to solve various puzzles and learn to use crystal energy for teleportation. There are also dragons.<br><br><strong>Game Features</strong><br><br>* Designed for room scale VR<br>* Suitable for multiplayer<br>* 11 rooms and only 1 hour until time runs out<br>* Magical atmosphere in a fantasy environment<br>* Beautiful graphics and immersive VR gameplay<br>* Various interesting mechanisms and well-designed puzzles throughout the story<br>* Simple controls - one button for overall intuitive gameplay and one button for teleportation<br><br>Game is built for everyone between age of 10 and 99 without any VR or HTC Vive experience.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"13620a48d7c31c88e60fa7119f986cb18ffccb2e.jpg","localized_name":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME_1_0","name":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME_1_0","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/988250/13620a48d7c31c88e60fa7119f986cb18ffccb2e.jpg"},{"icon":"e5b26da123b5d9bf073d0b9803315f6596e4391e.jpg","localized_name":"A Call From The Order","name":"A Call From The Order","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/988250/e5b26da123b5d9bf073d0b9803315f6596e4391e.jpg"},{"icon":"7dd618155354e5f925a532a4ccb0b6ba722915c5.jpg","localized_name":"Investigation","name":"Investigation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/988250/7dd618155354e5f925a532a4ccb0b6ba722915c5.jpg"},{"icon":"95c0985e9b7c3b41f800b271a7575996fbfa63d1.jpg","localized_name":"Searching for Answers","name":"Searching for Answers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/988250/95c0985e9b7c3b41f800b271a7575996fbfa63d1